{
 "code": "NO",
 "model": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14",
 "body": "<div id=\"wrf26\" class=\"wrf26\" lang=\"da\" data-until=\"2026-11-30T00:00:00+01:00\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"wrf26.css\">\n\n<!-- HERO -->\n<section class=\"w-hero\" id=\"intro\">\n<div class=\"w-hero-in\">\n\n<div class=\"w-hero-h\">\n  <p class=\"w-k\" data-r>Westpack presenterer</p>\n  <h2 class=\"w-h1\" data-r>World Record<br><s>Black</s> Friday</h2>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"w-hero-t\">\n  <p class=\"w-said\" data-r>“Så dere holder fortsatt ikke Black Friday?”</p>\n  <p class=\"w-ans\" data-r>Nei, vi gikk for verdensrekorder i stedet. Det var kanskje litt for ambisiøst…</p>\n  <p class=\"w-lead\" data-r>Fire kollegaer deltok med hvert sitt rekordforsøk, og vi filmet selvfølgelig alt sammen. Ingen av de offisielle verdensrekordene ble slått, men vi fikk fem videoer og litt mer respekt for folk som gjør dette profesjonelt. Se selv hvordan det gikk.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"w-hero-v\" data-r>\n  <figure class=\"w-vid\" data-v=\"1247537412\" data-h=\"2193656689\" data-title=\"@@C0@@\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"w-play\" aria-label=\"Se introen, 0:49\">\n      <img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/43e7efd4-41d9-43a0-8967-b667f64453b1.jpeg\" alt=\"Programlederen på lageret foran paller med Westpack-esker\" width=\"720\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <span class=\"w-pm\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><span>Se introen<em>0:49</em></span></span>\n    </button>\n  </figure>\n  <p class=\"w-cap\">Programlederen oppsummerte det veldig bra: <b>“There were questionable techniques, definitely.”</b></p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"w-roster\">\n  <p class=\"w-k\">Fire forsøk, fire resultater</p>\n  <ol class=\"w-rl\">\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"#martin\">\n        <img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/c157394c-78b0-4b20-ab65-e54c1b7f7528.jpeg\" alt=\"Martin\" width=\"400\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <span class=\"w-rt\"><span class=\"w-rn\"><small>01</small>Martin</span><span class=\"w-rr\">12</span><span class=\"w-ru\">esker i ett tårn</span><span class=\"w-rc\">Rekord: ingen</span></span>\n      </a>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"#mia\">\n        <img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/016d324d-0cad-4998-8f4b-96cbce5aa3e2.jpeg\" alt=\"Mia\" width=\"400\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <span class=\"w-rt\"><span class=\"w-rn\"><small>02</small>Mia</span><span class=\"w-rr\">18</span><span class=\"w-ru\">M&amp;M’s på ett minutt</span><span class=\"w-rc\">Rekord: 65</span></span>\n      </a>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"#cecilia\">\n        <img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/d02498c9-2f1e-4ace-bee7-79a1238b1ca3.jpeg\" alt=\"Cecilia\" width=\"400\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <span class=\"w-rt\"><span class=\"w-rn\"><small>03</small>Cecilia</span><span class=\"w-rr\">6,5<small>m</small></span><span class=\"w-ru\">strikk-skudd på lageret</span><span class=\"w-rc\">Rekord: 30,16 m</span></span>\n      </a>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n      <a href=\"#niklas\">\n        <img src=\"https://d3k81ch9hvuctc.cloudfront.net/company/VRPp5S/images/29e22141-2231-44a3-96e9-09c3184e6c17.jpeg\" alt=\"Niklas\" width=\"400\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\">\n        <span class=\"w-rt\"><span class=\"w-rn\"><small>04</small>Niklas</span><span class=\"w-rr\">52</span><span class=\"w-ru\">klesklyper i ansiktet</span><span class=\"w-rc\">Rekord: 161</span></span>\n      </a>\n    </li>\n  </ol>\n  <p class=\"w-hint\">Velg en deltaker og se hvordan forsøket gikk.</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- MARTIN -->\n<section class=\"w-p\" id=\"martin\">\n<div class=\"w-p-in\">\n\n<header class=\"w-p-h\" data-r>\n  <span class=\"w-bgn\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span>\n  <p class=\"w-k\">Deltaker 01</p>\n  <h2 class=\"w-name\">Martin</h2>\n  <p class=\"w-nick\">Tårnherren</p>\n</header>\n\n<div class=\"w-p-v\" data-r>\n  <figure class=\"w-vid\"